   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>(b)<br />\n<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> : If every subset of a language is decidable then it is finite and regular. Otherwise power set of infinite language is undecidable.<br />\n<em>S</em><sub>2</sub> : If L is a regular language then every subset is not decidable of L is infinite language.</p>"
  },
